---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: ""
description: "Do you own your music and want to play it anywhere? Cueport reads Serato or builds a library directly from your music files. It syncs music and metadata to your phone over the local network. Now you can play music, add cues, and edit sets on all your devices!"
homeMain: true
---

<div class="home-page">
  <section class="home-hero">
    <div class="container home-hero-inner home-hero-inner--single">
      <div class="home-copy">
        <p class="home-eyebrow">LOCAL-FIRST SOFTWARE</p>
        <h1 class="home-title"><span class="home-title-main">A multi-device workstation</span> <span class="home-title-tail">for DJs</span></h1>
        <div class="home-intro">
          <p class="home-question">{{ site.homeQuestion }}</p>
          <p class="home-sub">{{ site.homeDescription }}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="home-actions" aria-label="Primary actions">
          <div class="home-social">
          {% for item in site.social %}
            <a class="app-btn app-btn--social" href="{{ item.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="{{ item.ariaLabel }}">
              {% if item.icon == "instagram" %}
                <svg viewBox="2 2 20 20" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"/>
                  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/>
                  <circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="0.6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
                </svg>
              {% elif item.icon == "youtube" %}
                <svg viewBox="2 2 20 20" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <rect x="3" y="6" width="18" height="12" rx="3"/>
                  <path d="M10 9.5v5l5-2.5z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
                </svg>
              {% elif item.icon == "substack" %}
                <svg viewBox="-2 -2 28 28" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="none">
                  <path d="M22.539 8.242H1.46V5.406h21.08v2.836zM1.46 10.812V24L12 18.11 22.54 24V10.812H1.46zM22.54 0H1.46v2.836h21.08V0z" fill="currentColor"/>
                </svg>
              {% endif %}
            </a>
          {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section home-section--local" aria-labelledby="local-title">
    <div class="container home-section-grid">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="home-eyebrow">WHY LOCAL-FIRST</p>
        <h2 id="local-title">Your music, on your devices.</h2>
        <p>Cueport works with the music files you already own. Nothing streams from a server, so playback does not depend on your connection.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="benefit-grid">
        <li class="benefit">
          <span class="benefit-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter"><path d="M4 9h4l6-5v16l-6-5H4z"/><path d="M18 8c1.4 1.1 2 2.4 2 4s-.6 2.9-2 4"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <h3>Original files, original sound</h3>
            <p>Cueport plays your actual files, not a compressed stream. What you hear on iPhone is what you hear on your Mac.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="benefit">
          <span class="benefit-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 13a10 10 0 0 1 14 0"/><path d="M8.5 16.5a5 5 0 0 1 7 0"/><path d="M12 20h.01"/><path d="M3 4l18 18"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <h3>Plays without internet</h3>
            <p>Synced collections keep playing at a basement club, on a flight, or anywhere the signal drops.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="benefit">
          <span class="benefit-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter"><rect x="4" y="5" width="6" height="14"/><rect x="14" y="7" width="6" height="10"/><path d="M10 12h4"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <h3>Syncs over your network</h3>
            <p>Your Mac sends music to your iPhone over local Wi-Fi or a personal hotspot, not through a cloud service.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="benefit">
          <span class="benefit-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.6-2.8 8-7 10-4.2-2-7-5.4-7-10V6l7-3z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-5"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <h3>Private by default</h3>
            <p>Your library moves over your local network, not through an external server. Cueport does not upload your music, cues, crates, notes, or analytics.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section home-section--workflow" aria-labelledby="workflow-title">
    <div class="container home-section-grid">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="home-eyebrow">SET UP</p>
        <h2 id="workflow-title">Set up in three steps.</h2>
        <p>Use Serato or Cueport Direct on your Mac, then send selected collections to iPhone.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="setup-flow">
        <article class="setup-step">
          <span class="setup-step-marker">1</span>
          <div>
            <h2>Get Cueport for Mac</h2>
            <p>Install the app on your Mac.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <div class="flow-line flow-line--arrow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="flow-decision"><span>Choose a library</span></div>
        <div class="flow-split" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>
        <div class="flow-line flow-line--arrow flow-line--stacked" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="setup-options">
          <article class="setup-step">
            <span class="setup-step-marker">2A</span>
            <div>
              <h2>Serato library</h2>
              <p>Use your <code>_Serato_</code> folder to build your Cueport library.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <span class="flow-or">or</span>
          <article class="setup-step">
            <span class="setup-step-marker">2B</span>
            <div>
              <h2>Cueport Direct</h2>
              <p>Build your Cueport library directly from your music files.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-join" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>
        <div class="flow-line flow-line--arrow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <article class="setup-step">
          <span class="setup-step-marker">3</span>
          <div>
            <h2>Connect your iPhone</h2>
            <p>Sync selected collections to your phone.</p>
            <p class="tree-store-note">Available separately on the App Store.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
